Audio description track for shop-tour.mp4.
Every cue below describes information that appears ONLY on screen. Play the clip
with your eyes closed: without these descriptions you learn nothing except that a
bell rang somewhere. That is what WCAG 1.2.3 and 1.2.5 are about.

Practical warning for students: browser support for kind="descriptions" is poor,
and no major browser speaks these cues aloud today. This is the correct markup and
it is machine-readable, but a real project usually ships audio description as a
separate described audio track or a described version of the video. Do not assume
adding this file makes a video conform.

